# Derived by hand from ruling DD: a placeholder displays (`hi`, `q`), `Debug` quotes a text and writes a character as its literal, and a placeholder bounded by `^Display` displays at its instance.
test a_text_displays_as_itself_and_debugs_quoted

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="hi q 7 True")
    1: Ui.Label(text="\"hi\" 'q' 7")
    2: Ui.Label(text="[hi] [q] 7")
